      "end": 102.475
    },
    {
      "text": "A creative authors a template «Lolly for Creators»; you take that exact tool and scale it - into a pipeline, a CLI batch or an MCP endpoint - so a non-designer can self-serve the finished asset offline, and an AI agent can run it at a volume no person would sit through.",
